  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of workers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As a result of the ILO technical and financial support, the General Federation of Oman Workers (GFOW) was able to extend its presence among workers all over the country and successfully engage with the government and employers&#x2019; organization in voicing workers&#x2019; interests which resulted in the issuance of new important legislations, the labour, and social security laws. During this biennium,  ILO will continue its support to GFOW to improve its services to members with a view to recruiting new groups of workers, and to influence the socio-economic policies. Moreover, to continue providing GFOW and its affiliated unions with the needed support to promote Fundamental Principles and Rights at Work (FPRW) and to improve its capacities and structures to provide youth workers, women workers, and migrant workers with protection and services.</narrative>
  </description>
